@chapter Overview of Heroes
@cindex  overview
@cindex  nibble
Heroes is a game inspired from Nibbles (or Tron), but with a lot of
enhancements.

In a Nibbles-like game, you drive a kind of snake whose tail grows
when you eat certain bonuses.  You can't cross your tail, so the more you
grow the more difficult the game is.  The aim is to get ten of these bonuses.

Heroes features several game mode that are variations over these rules.
Quest is the classical Nibbles, in Death Match you start with very long
tails a must kill your opponents, in Kill'em All you must run over
lemmings moving on the ground, in Color or Time Cash you must collect
money or pyramids of color.

Heroes can be played by one or two players. It features 12 original
soundtracks, 94 levels (in 10 different tilesets) plus a level
editor. 

Heroes was a DOS game and this is the Linux port.  Presently, the port
is incomplete, the main missing feature is the level editor.

